  "body": "Version: 1.46 to 1.54\r\n\r\n 1. Server configured with `jwt_config.enabled=true`\r\n 1. Login a test user  with `type=org.matrix.login.jwt` and token\r\n 1. With admin user, deactivate the test user `/_synapse/admin/v1/deactivate/{userid}`\r\n 1. Relogin the test user  with `type=org.matrix.login.jwt` and token \r\n    - -> here the login is success\r\n    - => should be refused with `403` `M_USER_DEACTIVATED`\r\n\r\n",
